NOTICE ON THIRD-PARTY WEIGHTS AND MODELS:
The optional face verification module references the InsightFace `buffalo_l` model weights.
InsightFace models and pre-trained weights are licensed by their respective authors for
non-commercial research purposes only. For commercial production deployments, verify model
licensing or replace the embedding model with commercially licensed face verification models.
